=== db-redirect ===
Contributors: valentinalisch
Tags: mobile browsers, mobile redirect, mobile, redirect, iPhone, iPhone redirect, smartphone, handheld, portable browsers, portable, mobile site, alternative site, simple, valentinalisch, valentin alisch, valentin
Requires at least: 3.2
Tested up to: 3.3.2
Stable tag: trunk

Simple plugIn to redirect mobile browsers.

== Description ==

__Description:__ <br />
This is a simple plugIn to redirect nearly every known mobile browsers visiting your wordpress site
to another alternative URL. <br />
You can specify this URL in the admin panel of the plugIn.

Redirection depends on the HTTP_HEADER information sent by the user's device. <br />
Detection is based on the Mobile Browser ID Strings taken from here: <br />
[http://www.zytrax.com/tech/web/mobile_ids.html](http://www.zytrax.com/tech/web/mobile_ids.html "mobile ids")

